{"id":"54826de3b846056d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nerode-quotient-notation.md","title":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation","display":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation","display":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-nerode-quotient-notation","73-definition-3.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation — nerode quotient notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f41b3be50448ef3b\" href=\"?note=f41b3be50448ef3b\" title=\"73-df-language-residual-equivalence\">73-df-language-residual-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nerode-quotient-notation</span><span>73-definition-3.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f41b3be50448ef3b\" href=\"?note=f41b3be50448ef3b\" title=\"73-df-language-residual-equivalence\">73-df-language-residual-equivalence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{index}\">\\(\\mathrm{index}\\)</span> 只作用于本环境的右同余关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_L\">\\([x]_L\\)</span> 是下述等价类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_Ly\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\nx\\equiv_Ly\\leftrightarrow\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(xz\\in L\\leftrightarrow yz\\in L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:x\\equiv_Ly\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\coloneqq|\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n[x]_L\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Sigma^*:x\\equiv_Ly\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\coloneqq|\\{[x]_L:x\\in\\Sigma^*\\}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{